      },
      {
        "text": "Humbling one's expectations about change reflects responsible engagement in foreign policy.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Political transformation cannot be imposed without addressing underlying societal divisions.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker views humility as a morally appropriate response to complex socio-political realities.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "Existing power dynamics and identities (ethnic, religious) are durable and resistant to top-down reform.",
