    "turn_idx": 137,
    "turn_text": "Well, so the intelligence community assessment didn't just identify Russian intelligence services or their affiliates as the ones who hacked those emails and released them. They also gave some reasons for it. Those reasons include a general effort to discredit Western democracy and American democracy, in particular, an effort to pay back Hillary Clinton for some of the things she had said and done during her tenure as",
