    "turn_idx": 196,
    "turn_text": "You, Arkansas has been a big beneficiary of the Affordable Care Act. Your uninsured rate has gone from 21% down, I think, to 8% or 9% second best performance of any of the states. I think Kentucky is the only one that did better. Do you have concerns about going backward in terms of insurance in your",
