        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Repealing the individual mandate would not cause people to lose their insurance but rather lead some to choose not to purchase it.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Not all current Medicaid recipients will remain on Medicaid indefinitely.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Giving states greater flexibility and authority over their Medicaid systems is a viable approach to improving healthcare access.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "States should be held accountable for responsible spending within their Medicaid programs.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Moving individuals from Medicaid to market-based insurance is preferable.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      }
    ],
    "assumptions": [
